sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant RUNNER as run_episode / run_policy.py
    participant POL as TrainedPolicy (EvalPolicy)
    participant VN as VecNormalize (frozen)
    participant SAC as SB3 SAC actor (GPU)
    participant ENV as SO101ReachEnv (Gymnasium)
    participant RB as MujocoSo101Backend
    participant MJ as MuJoCo

    Note over RUNNER,MJ: Load once per seed
    RUNNER->>POL: load_trained_policy(seed_dir)
    POL->>VN: VecNormalize.load(vecnormalize.pkl), training=False
    POL->>SAC: SAC.load(model.zip) on cuda

    Note over RUNNER,MJ: Episode start (fixed seed, same targets for every policy)
    RUNNER->>ENV: reset(seed=10000 + episode)
    ENV->>RB: reset(rng), set_target_marker(target)
    ENV-->>RUNNER: raw obs
    RUNNER->>POL: reset(target, state)

    Note over RUNNER,MJ: Every step until step 150
    RUNNER->>POL: policy(obs)
    POL->>VN: normalize_obs(obs)
    POL->>SAC: predict(norm_obs, deterministic=True)
    SAC-->>POL: mean action in [-1, 1], no exploration noise
    POL-->>RUNNER: action
    RUNNER->>ENV: step(action)
    ENV->>RB: apply_delta, step
    RB->>MJ: mj_step x 33
    RB-->>ENV: RobotState
    ENV-->>RUNNER: obs, reward (ignored), info.distance_m
    RUNNER->>RUNNER: record distance and joint speed

    Note over RUNNER,MJ: After the episode
    RUNNER->>RUNNER: keep last 30 steps, summarize to PolicyReport, check pass/fail
